== (a) U depends on momenta only
argument p1 - p2: pdot_1 = [0, 0, 0]; xdot_1 - p1/m1 = [Subs(Derivative(U(_xi_1, p1_2 - p2_2, p1_3 - p2_3), _xi_1), _xi_1, p1_1 - p2_1)]...;
   d(m1 x1 + m2 x2)/dt - P = [(m1 - m2)*Subs(Derivative(U(_xi_1, p1_2 - p2_2, p1_3 - p2_3), _xi_1), _xi_1, p1_1 - p2_1), (m1 - m2)*Subs(Derivative(U(p1_1 - p2_1, _xi_2, p1_3 - p2_3), _xi_2), _xi_2, p1_2 - p2_2), (m1 - m2)*Subs(Derivative(U(p1_1 - p2_1, p1_2 - p2_2, _xi_3), _xi_3), _xi_3, p1_3 - p2_3)]; argument shift under boost = [u1*(m1 - m2), u2*(m1 - m2), u3*(m1 - m2)]
argument k = (m2 p1 - m1 p2)/M: pdot_1 = [0, 0, 0]; xdot_1 - p1/m1 = [m2*Subs(Derivative(U(_xi_1, (-m1*p2_2 + m2*p1_2)/(m1 + m2), (-m1*p2_3 + m2*p1_3)/(m1 + m2)), _xi_1), _xi_1, (-m1*p2_1 + m2*p1_1)/(m1 + m2))/(m1 + m2)]...;
   d(m1 x1 + m2 x2)/dt - P = [0, 0, 0]; argument shift under boost = [0, 0, 0]
argument p1/m1 - p2/m2: pdot_1 = [0, 0, 0]; xdot_1 - p1/m1 = [Subs(Derivative(U(_xi_1, -p2_2/m2 + p1_2/m1, -p2_3/m2 + p1_3/m1), _xi_1), _xi_1, -p2_1/m2 + p1_1/m1)/m1]...;
   d(m1 x1 + m2 x2)/dt - P = [0, 0, 0]; argument shift under boost = [0, 0, 0]
Legendre check with generic U (sympy Subs expansion): False
Legendre check with concrete U = s^3/3 + sin s + exp(-s^2): v recovered to O(eps): [0, 0] ; L - [sum m v^2/2 - eps U(m1 v1 - m2 v2)] = 0
L to O(eps) - [m1 v1^2/2 + m2 v2^2/2 - eps U(m1 v1 - m2 v2)] = 0
d xdot1/d p1 (1D) = epsilon*Subs(Derivative(u(_xi_1), (_xi_1, 2)), _xi_1, P1 - P2) + 1/m1  (inverse mass shifted by U'')
Born image of p^2/2m + V(x): V(p_s) + x_s**2/(2*m1) -> xdot = Derivative(V(p_s), p_s) , pdot = -x_s/m1

== (b) Newtonian potential gated in relative velocity
energy function - [sum m v^2/2 - Gt m1 m2 (W - w W')/r] = 0
canonical p1 - m1 v1 (first component): Gtilde*m1*m2*(W1_1 - W2_1)*Subs(Derivative(W(_xi_1), _xi_1), _xi_1, sqrt((W1_1 - W2_1)**2 + (W1_2 - W2_2)**2 + (W1_3 - W2_3)**2)/v_star)/(v_star*sqrt((W1_1 - W2_1)**2 + (W1_2 - W2_2)**2 + (W1_3 - W2_3)**2)*sqrt((X1_1 - X2_1)**2 + (X1_2 - X2_2)**2 + (X1_3 - X2_3)**2))
L(boosted) - L - [u.(m1 v1 + m2 v2) + M u^2/2] = 0  (remainder is d/dt[u.(m1x1+m2x2) + M u^2 t/2])
Lagrangian Hessian at v_rel = 0 (Gaussian W): -2*Gtilde*M*mu/(r*v_star**2) + mu * identity -> zero at r_* = 2 Gt M/v*^2: [2*Gtilde*M/v_star**2]
first-order Legendre check: True ; L - [mu v^2/2 + eta Gt M mu W(v/v*)/r] = 0
Hamiltonian inverse inertia d2H/dp2 at p = 0: 2*Gtilde*M/(mu*r*v_star**2) + 1/mu  = (1/mu)(1 + 2 Gt M/(r v*^2))
argument |p1/m1 - p2/m2|/v*: pdot_1 - (gated Newton force) = [0, 0, 0]; d(m1x1+m2x2)/dt - P zero: True
argument |p1 - p2|/(m1 v*)  [non-invariant]: pdot_1 - (gated Newton force) = [0, 0, 0]; d(m1x1+m2x2)/dt - P zero: False

